\
Do not flatten all research into "content ideas."\
\
Different source types require different evidence.\
\
### LinkedIn-derived opportunity\
\
Preserve:\
\
Source post\
+\
URL\
+\
Author\
+\
Available performance metrics\
+\
ICP engagement evidence\
+\
Underlying idea\
+\
What made it interesting\
+\
Potential CXO Hive adaptation\
\
### News / market-derived opportunity\
\
Preserve:\
\
Source/event\
+\
URL\
+\
What happened\
+\
Why it matters\
+\
ICP relevance\
+\
What conversation it creates\
+\
Potential CXO Hive angle\
\
### ICP-derived opportunity\
\
Preserve:\
\
Observed ICP behavior\
+\
Evidence\
+\
